    {
      "confidence": "partial",
      "id": "POSITION-01",
      "rule": "Registered IAnnotation.GetPosition slot70 ->42aaef80 ->42abaaf0 obtains the actual modeled display. Actual notes exclude the moDisplayDim-only branch and invoke display+3b0 ->4be6d3f0, which calls actual note+4c0 ->4c7fb480. Registered INote.GetTextPoint2 slot3b8 ->42d85500 ->42d92350 invokes the same +4c0."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "partial",
      "id": "POSITION-02",
      "rule": "For actual ordinary moDisplayNote, +9a0 and +9b0 resolve to the same concrete false leaf4b27cbe0. The +4c0 getter obtains actual F from+370 and actual A from getAttachLocation(0), then returns ((A*F)+(V*d))*inverse(F), with V=f628,d=f630. It does not read the text object f38. Stacked-note alternate output is excluded by the actual concrete predicate."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "partial",
      "id": "POSITION-03",
      "rule": "getAttachLocation(0) reads actual display.f290 when f298 is null, its count<=1, or row0 is absent. With count>1 and actual row0, it copies row0.f08. It does not dereference an absolute-point attachment for this operation."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "partial",
      "id": "POSITION-04",
      "rule": "Actual note+370 returns identity when display.f3e0&0x1000000. Otherwise ordinary +9a0=false selects stored display.f2a0. If actual model resolves and actual current view is a visible moAnnotationView rather than view id199, nonzero view rotation adjusts that returned frame. General annotation-view transformation policy is not a zero default."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "partial",
      "id": "POSITION-05",
      "rule": "Actual point setter+4c8 computes local displacement Q=(requested-A)*F using the vector transform. +380 may force local Q.z=0; actual plain note predicate is !f644. A nonzero eligible Q is normalized and written into f628. The distance is sqrt(Q.sqlen()), stored through actual +3f8 leaf4c80e480. Zero Q keeps existing direction and stores distance0; mirrored-view branches remain explicit."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "partial",
      "id": "POSITION-06",
      "rule": "Registered SetPosition2 slot388 ->42ab5c30 ->42abdac0 passes flag1. The DisplayDim-only transform helper42abad40 returns0 for actual notes. The selected note path dispatches +3b8 ->4b347fb0 tail+3c0 ->4c80cf70, which reads current+3b0, derives requested-minus-current translation, gets actual F and calls +340. Actual +340 at4c80a520 reads+4c0, applies the supplied transform, and calls+4c8. This is not a direct write to text.f38."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "confirmed",
      "id": "POSITION-07",
      "rule": "The root-supplied typed differential reports exactly zero position residual in all four disclosed source rows and f630 equal to the norm from actual cached attachment to intended text point within floating representation. This corroborates the selected formula only; fields are not fed from those rows into a generator.",
